# Software Engineering 2026

A structured, hands-on journey to become a production-ready software engineer in the AI era.

> **The objective is to become an engineer who understands the system behind the code.**

This repository is not a collection of tutorials or copied code. It is a record of how I build fundamentals, engineering judgment, architecture knowledge, cloud/DevOps skills, security awareness, and AI-assisted development practice.

