## Guiding Questions

When looking at any system, I should be able to ask:

```text
What is happening, and why?
What are the constraints and trade-offs?
What can fail, and how do I verify my assumptions?
How should I design, deploy, monitor, debug, and secure it?
And when AI writes part of it: do I actually understand what it produced?
```

**Start small. Understand deeply. Build continuously. Break things. Debug them. Document the lessons.**